{
  "name": "Schedule social media posts from a Notion database, checked before they go out",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule posts from a Notion content database\n\nThe Google Sheets calendar template, for teams that plan in Notion.\n\n### How it works\n1. Every 15 minutes, pages with **Status** `Ready` are read.\n2. A **Media URL** is uploaded to Preflight first.\n3. Preflight checks each post against every channel's rules.\n4. Pages that pass are scheduled for **Publish At** and get `Scheduled` and the post ID; the rest get `Needs fix` and the reason.\n\n### Setup\n1. Needs the verified community node **Preflight** ([n8n-nodes-preflight](https://www.npmjs.com/package/n8n-nodes-preflight) 0.1.1 or later): search for Preflight in the nodes panel and choose Install. Tested on n8n 2.43.\n2. In [Preflight](https://preflight.social) (the free plan works), connect your social accounts, then create an API key under Settings → API keys with the scopes `posts:read`, `posts:write`, `posts:publish`, `media:read` and `media:write`, and add it as a **Preflight API** credential.\n3. Give the database these properties: `Name` (title), `Text` (text), `Channels` (text), `Publish At` (date with time), `Media URL` (URL), `Status` (status: Ready, Scheduled, Needs fix), `Preflight ID` (text), `Issues` (text).\n4. Pick the database in **Pages marked Ready** and add a Notion credential to the Notion nodes.\n\n### Customization\n- Empty **Channels** uses **defaultChannels** from Configuration.",
        "height": 860,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "e8b17c6c-3d68-5918-8a2e-bb777bb9243f",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -800,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "937a2041-5346-577d-aced-da7a1814b7be",
      "name": "Every 15 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "44127a08-da4f-5be1-895e-413c8844db04",
              "name": "defaultChannels",
              "value": "bluesky, mastodon",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c01ae89b-2c69-509c-8822-10cf1d2b670a",
      "name": "Configuration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "databaseId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "returnAll": true,
        "filterType": "manual",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "key": "Status|status",
              "condition": "equals",
              "statusValue": "Ready"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dd70f656-5740-58aa-b9d9-e2a3dd07940f",
      "name": "Pages marked Ready",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "1b7accc5-618d-5f49-ba93-d51ae9992b15",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.property_media_url }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "25528c94-97fd-5606-b047-284582063c0a",
      "name": "Has a file?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "media",
        "operation": "upload",
        "source": "url",
        "sourceUrl": "={{ $json.property_media_url }}",
        "kind": "auto",
        "waitUntilReady": true
      },
      "id": "87dfb8e5-6ce5-5025-9d24-e3dd8f27f9d4",
      "name": "Upload file to Preflight",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-preflight.preflight",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        880,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c286b979-d426-531a-8ad0-2da46a524266",
              "name": "pageId",
              "value": "={{ $('Pages marked Ready').item.json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "588769aa-b26d-5ce6-b4b4-830fd3a5a2d5",
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $('Pages marked Ready').item.json.property_text }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "78644aab-0d9c-5be5-a88a-c372c25612e7",
              "name": "channels",
              "value": "={{ $('Pages marked Ready').item.json.property_channels || $('Configuration').first().json.defaultChannels }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "85d161e8-b835-57d3-89de-8c29355f6f38",
              "name": "publishAt",
              "value": "={{ $('Pages marked Ready').item.json.property_publish_at?.start }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "92f70f1f-1c56-57c1-904a-c8c784dc4ede",
              "name": "mediaId",
              "value": "={{ $json.kind ? $json.id : '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d90ec4dd-963e-5c41-98e5-3b5be3ae0c0f",
      "name": "Post to check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "post",
        "operation": "validate",
        "channels": "={{ $('Post to check').item.json.channels }}",
        "content": "={{ $('Post to check').item.json.text }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "mediaIds": "={{ $('Post to check').item.json.mediaId }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "4d68cacc-d6b6-5dea-8377-df9fdf7e13f9",
      "name": "Check against network rules",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-preflight.preflight",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "58aa6f09-49ae-55c8-9b9a-41b196c3cb78",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "88045dcc-3b0f-532c-96fc-9cd1afe5e689",
      "name": "Passes every network?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1540,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "post",
        "operation": "create",
        "channels": "={{ $('Post to check').item.json.channels }}",
        "content": "={{ $('Post to check').item.json.text }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "mediaIds": "={{ $('Post to check').item.json.mediaId }}"
        },
        "when": "scheduled",
        "scheduledAt": "={{ $('Post to check').item.json.publishAt }}",
        "idempotencyKey": "={{ 'notion-' + $('Post to check').item.json.pageId + '-' + $('Post to check').item.json.text.hash('sha256') }}"
      },
      "id": "599001db-d2d0-501b-aa32-134fc785bf32",
      "name": "Schedule in Preflight",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-preflight.preflight",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1760,
        -100
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "update",
        "pageId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('Post to check').item.json.pageId }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "propertiesUi": {
          "propertyValues": [
            {
              "key": "Status|status",
              "statusValue": "Scheduled"
            },
            {
              "key": "Preflight ID|rich_text",
              "textContent": "={{ $json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5d3a3d3a-40a7-5c12-8a13-9c792b9794bf",
      "name": "Mark Scheduled",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1980,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "update",
        "pageId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('Post to check').item.json.pageId }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "propertiesUi": {
          "propertyValues": [
            {
              "key": "Status|status",
              "statusValue": "Needs fix"
            },
            {
              "key": "Issues|rich_text",
              "textContent": "={{ $json.issues.map(i => (i.platform ? i.platform + ': ' : '') + i.message).join('\\n') }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8430fdaa-7f49-54cf-b038-add87142f3cd",
      "name": "Mark Needs fix",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        120
      ]
    }
  ],
